  "description": "Select tests by risk, design strong regression and boundary tests, handle flaky suites, and run the completion gate with evidence: exact command, result, scope, and every skipped or blocked check. Use when choosing what to test, judging whether work is done, or producing release evidence. Never weaken a failing test to get green.",
